# 换行统一：shell 脚本 / Dockerfile 必须是 LF，否则 Linux 上会报
# "bad interpreter: No such file or directory" 或容器启动失败。
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
docker-entrypoint.sh text eol=lf

# 明确的二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.gz binary
*.zip binary

# Git 统计时把生成物当文档，避免语言统计跑偏
targets/*.txt linguist-documentation
